I left out the `aap:caps/http-client` import and the enrichment fetch. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/notifier@0.1.0`, and the graph definition hasn't been updated yet. The fetch would also send feed text in a URL to an external host, which the notifier-only grant doesn't allow. If the platform team updates the grant in the graph, I can add the import and the fetch then.

